  "agent_notes": "Assault and Threatened assault are grouping stubs; Face-to-face and Non face-to-face are threatened-assault subtypes. Total threatened assault and Total assault are retained subtotals. Counts relate to 2010–11; rate columns retain individual years. Blank counts and rates are not imputed. RSE sheets identify sampling errors in title and block labels. Separate populated row runs avoid the runner expanding comma-separated values ranges to bounding rectangles and emitting null observations.",
